{"baseline":{"amendments":[],"id":"heat-spreader-sizing-03-basis","requirements":[{"id":"HEAT03-GEOMETRY","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Candidate geometry and material inputs","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"}],"text":"Each candidate is an unperforated 120 mm long, 2 mm thick rectangular plate with declared width 60, 80, or 100 mm, within the 125 mm by 104 mm envelope."},{"id":"HEAT03-BOUNDARIES","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Contact-resistance requirement","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/boundary-conditions.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"251f75f98e10aa9984e1103a78f48fc00bb367a6c63422eedfe75f2645940c09"}],"text":"The numerical model applies total 18 W uniformly to the complete X=120 mm face, uses a 35 °C external rail reference, and insulates all longitudinal faces."},{"id":"HEAT03-CONTACT","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Contact-resistance requirement","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/boundary-conditions.csv","locator":"row:cold_contact","sha256":"251f75f98e10aa9984e1103a78f48fc00bb367a6c63422eedfe75f2645940c09"}],"text":"Every required candidate includes the declared 0.15 K/W total whole-interface cold-end resistance using a mathematically equivalent candidate-specific boundary conversion; it is never treated as 0.15 m²·K/W or silently removed."},{"id":"HEAT03-MATERIAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Candidate geometry and material inputs","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"conductivity_w_mk,density_kg_m3","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"}],"text":"The model uses constant thermal conductivity 385 W/(m·K) and density 8960 kg/m³ as synthetic copper-like properties without claiming a certified grade."},{"id":"HEAT03-FIELDS","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/prompt.txt","locator":"requested steady fields","sha256":"54927501df8280812d1607db547ebc5c2b8ee5a9c3716e1b5b17f8c3f609b53b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Contact-resistance requirement; Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"All three required contact-resistance candidates retain actual coarse and refined numerical temperature fields distinct from analytical or ideal-contact comparisons."},{"id":"HEAT03-UNSUPPORTED-DISPOSITION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/prompt.txt","locator":"unsupported solver instruction","sha256":"54927501df8280812d1607db547ebc5c2b8ee5a9c3716e1b5b17f8c3f609b53b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Contact-resistance requirement","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"If the backend cannot represent total contact resistance, the result explicitly blocks that requirement and labels any ideal-contact solve as a separate noncompliant comparison."},{"id":"HEAT03-ANALYTICAL","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Contact-resistance requirement","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"}],"text":"Each required numerical hot-end temperature agrees within 2% of the rise predicted by 18 W times [L/(k·W·t)+0.15 K/W] for that candidate."},{"id":"HEAT03-BALANCE","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"heat_input_w","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"}],"text":"Each refined candidate field has total heat removal within 1% of the declared 18 W input."},{"id":"HEAT03-REFINEMENT","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"Each candidate's coarse-to-refined hot-end temperature-rise change is at most 2% and retains both mesh identities."},{"id":"HEAT03-OUTCOMES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"all rows","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Objective and fabrication context","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"The decision records the computed compliance outcome for 60, 80, and 100 mm widths against the inclusive 75 °C limit with the contact resistance included."},{"id":"HEAT03-SELECTION","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"design","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/prompt.txt","locator":"selection request","sha256":"54927501df8280812d1607db547ebc5c2b8ee5a9c3716e1b5b17f8c3f609b53b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/alternatives.csv","locator":"width_mm,density_kg_m3,limit_c","sha256":"b317dc1420a6ed5fcb93d80fc6e9a4e2c359f90a7392cab623253f1368e34199"}],"text":"The sizing decision selects copper_80 as the lowest-mass declared candidate at or below 75 °C under the required resistance model."},{"id":"HEAT03-REVIEW","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"A recorded design review confirms contact-resistance units, per-candidate interface area, material constants, and boundary names before solving."},{"id":"HEAT03-DELIVERABLES","mandatory":true,"review_required":false,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/prompt.txt","locator":"requested outputs","sha256":"54927501df8280812d1607db547ebc5c2b8ee5a9c3716e1b5b17f8c3f609b53b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"The output set contains all candidate CAD, numerical fields, heat-balance data, coarse/fine mesh evidence, and a machine-readable sizing decision."},{"id":"HEAT03-CLAIM-SCOPE","mandatory":true,"review_required":true,"scope":"content","sources":[{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/prompt.txt","locator":"claim limitation","sha256":"54927501df8280812d1607db547ebc5c2b8ee5a9c3716e1b5b17f8c3f609b53b"},{"artifact_ref":"tests/datasets/engineering-workflows/scenarios/heat-spreader-sizing/03-calibration-lamp-copper-link/context.md","locator":"Application and model boundary; Evidence, review, and limits","sha256":"340c6537b381c62e4760d3d38dfa54e3cde3973417e3c6fe15a8a6c3634b29e4"}],"text":"Reported conclusions remain limited to the syn